   "locked": false,
   "text": "With cross-Region inference, turn 2 can land in a different Region and miss the cache, so expect more cache writes.\nAWS doesn't publish whether cached prefixes also spill to host memory or SSD.\nAu. price for Sonnet 4.5: input $3.30/MTok · cache write $4.125 (5 min) or $6.60 (1 h) · cache read $0.33.",
   "originalText": "With cross-Region inference, turn 2 can land in a different Region and miss the cache, so expect more cache writes.\nAWS doesn't publish whether cached prefixes also spill to host memory or SSD.\nAu. price for Sonnet 4.5: input $3.30/MTok · cache write $4.125 (5 min) or $6.60 (1 h) · cache read $0.33.",
